"199":{"hiLyricsEn":"Still somewhere inside me, a place remains.\nStill somewhere inside me, a voice is awake.\nStill somewhere inside me, you are calling.\nStill somewhere inside me.","hiLyricsHi":"अभी मुझ में कहीं, कोई जगह बाकी है.\nअभी मुझ में कहीं, एक आवाज़ जागी है.\nअभी मुझ में कहीं, तुम पुकारते हो.\nअभी मुझ में कहीं.","heLyricsEn":"So I left.\nI did not say goodbye, I did not say where.\nThe door closed, and the street took me.\nSo I left.","heLyricsHe":"אז הלכתי.\nלא אמרתי שלום, לא אמרתי לאן.\nהדלת נסגרה, והרחוב לקח אותי.\nאז הלכתי.","quoteEn":"Receive without pride, let go without attachment.","quoteHi":"गर्व के बिना लो, आसक्ति के बिना छोड़ो।","quoteHe":"קבל בלי גאווה, שחרר בלי היצמדות.","cite":"Marcus Aurelius","heVideo":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ITzMQKr523Y","hiVideo":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oWKgpB2zpgw"},
"201":{"hiLyricsEn":"Embrace me, for this beautiful night may not come again.\nPerhaps in this life we will not meet again.\nI may not remain, you may not remain, and no one will say it.\nStay close. Embrace me.","hiLyricsHi":"लग जा गले, कि फिर ये हसीं रात हो न हो.\nशायद फिर इस जनम में मुलाकात हो न हो.\nहम न रहें, तुम न रहो, फिर कोई न कहे.\nपास रहो. लग जा गले.","heLyricsEn":"She says she is leaving.\nShe says the night is over.\nShe says, do not follow.\nShe says, she says.","heLyricsHe":"היא אומרת שהיא הולכת.\nהיא אומרת שהלילה נגמר.\nהיא אומרת, אל תבוא אחרי.\nהיא אומרת, היא אומרת.","quoteEn":"It is not death that a man should fear, but never beginning to live.","quoteHi":"मृत्यु से नहीं, कभी जीना शुरू न करने से डरो।","quoteHe":"אל תירא מהמוות, אלא מכך שלא התחלת לחיות.","cite":"Marcus Aurelius","heVideo":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qfxgip3SYlA","hiVideo":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TFr6G5zveS8"},
"202":{"hiLyricsEn":"Still somewhere inside me, a place remains.\nStill somewhere inside me, a voice is awake.\nStill somewhere inside me, you are calling.\nStill somewhere inside me.","hiLyricsHi":"अभी मुझ में कहीं, कोई जगह बाकी है.\nअभी मुझ में कहीं, एक आवाज़ जागी है.\nअभी मुझ में कहीं, तुम पुकारते हो.\nअभी मुझ में कहीं.","heLyricsEn":"So I left.\nI did not say goodbye, I did not say where.\nThe door closed, and the street took me.\nSo I left.","heLyricsHe":"אז הלכתי.\nלא אמרתי שלום, לא אמרתי לאן.\nהדלת נסגרה, והרחוב לקח אותי.\nאז הלכתי.","quoteEn":"The object of life is not to be on the side of the majority.","quoteHi":"जीवन का लक्ष्य बहुमत के साथ होना नहीं है।","quoteHe":"מטרת החיים אינה להיות עם הרוב.","cite":"Marcus Aurelius","heVideo":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ITzMQKr523Y","hiVideo":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oWKgpB2zpgw"},
"203":{"hiLyricsEn":"Embrace me, for this beautiful night may not come again.\nPerhaps in this life we will not meet again.\nI may not remain, you may not remain, and no one will say it.\nStay close. Embrace me.","hiLyricsHi":"लग जा गले, कि फिर ये हसीं रात हो न हो.\nशायद फिर इस जनम में मुलाकात हो न हो.\nहम न रहें, तुम न रहो, फिर कोई न कहे.\nपास रहो. लग जा गले.","heLyricsEn":"She says she is leaving.\nShe says the night is over.\nShe says, do not follow.\nShe says, she says.","heLyricsHe":"היא אומרת שהיא הולכת.\nהיא אומרת שהלילה נגמר.\nהיא אומרת, אל תבוא אחרי.\nהיא אומרת, היא אומרת.","quoteEn":"Never value anything as profitable that compels you to break your promise.","quoteHi":"जो वचन तोड़वाए उसे लाभ मत मानो।","quoteHe":"אל תחשיב לרווח דבר שמכריח אותך להפר הבטחה.","cite":"Marcus Aurelius","heVideo":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qfxgip3SYlA","hiVideo":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TFr6G5zveS8"},
"204":{"hiLyricsEn":"Still somewhere inside me, a place remains.\nStill somewhere inside me, a voice is awake.\nStill somewhere inside me, you are calling.\nStill somewhere inside me.","hiLyricsHi":"अभी मुझ में कहीं, कोई जगह बाकी है.\nअभी मुझ में कहीं, एक आवाज़ जागी है.\nअभी मुझ में कहीं, तुम पुकारते हो.\nअभी मुझ में कहीं.","heLyricsEn":"So I left.\nI did not say goodbye, I did not say where.\nThe door closed, and the street took me.\nSo I left.","heLyricsHe":"אז הלכתי.\nלא אמרתי שלום, לא אמרתי לאן.\nהדלת נסגרה, והרחוב לקח אותי.\nאז הלכתי.","quoteEn":"How much more grievous are the consequences of anger than the causes of it.","quoteHi":"क्रोध के परिणाम उसके कारण से भारी होते हैं।","quoteHe":"תוצאות הכעס כבדות מסיבותיו.","cite":"Marcus Aurelius","heVideo":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ITzMQKr523Y","hiVideo":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oWKgpB2zpgw"},
